\title{Orbit}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2026-11-24}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{Let #{G} act on a set #{X} and #{x \in X}. The \em{orbit} of #{x \in X} is given by}

##{\operatorname{Orb}_G(x) = \lbrace g(x) : g \in G\rbrace  \subseteq X,}

\p{i.e. the set of points in #{X} which #{x} can be mapped to.}
